      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-light-page\" data-v-83b244fe><section id=\"section-property-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative pb-32 max-md:pb-12 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:8rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:3rem;\" data-v-83b244fe data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-hero__grid grid w-full items-center gap-16 max-md:gap-10\" data-v-83b244fe><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-8\" data-v-83b244fe><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-83b244fe><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-83b244fe></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-83b244fe>Property</p></div><h1 class=\"industry-hero__headline text-6xl font-normal text-slatecolor max-md:text-5xl\" data-v-83b244fe><span class=\"block\" data-v-83b244fe>Build AI into the</span><span class=\"block\" data-v-83b244fe>way your property</span><span class=\"block\" data-v-83b244fe>business works.</span></h1><p class=\"max-w-prose text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-83b244fe>AI is changing how property businesses win customers, manage portfolios, develop products and operate at scale. We design and build AI that grows your revenue and scales the amount of properties you can manage.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\" data-v-83b244fe><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pointer-events-auto\" data-v-83b244fe><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-spark shadow-button hover:bg-s