      "html": "<section id=\"section-property-clients\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative items-center gap-20 pt-12 pb-32 max-md:pt-8 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto bg-light-page\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"text-reveal-pending logo-strip-heading pointer-events-auto m-0 w-full max-md:hidden text-center text-3xl font-normal text-slatecolor\"><span class=\"text-reveal-word\">Trusted</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">by</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">property</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">businesses</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">building</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">AI</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">they</span> <span class=\"text-reveal-word\">own.</span></h2><ul class=\"logo-strip__grid pointer-events-auto grid w-full gap-3 logo-strip__grid--five logo-strip__grid--odd\"><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/upstix-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Upstix\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/heylo-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Heylo\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/home-reach-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Home Reach\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/rehaus-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"REHAUS\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li><li class=\"pointer-events-auto flex min-h-40 max-md:min-h-32 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-chalk px-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/here-east-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Here East\" class=\"logo-strip-image pointer-events-auto\"></li></ul></section>"
