      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-425e4d9f><section id=\"section-property-challenge\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-425e4d9f data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-challenge__grid grid w-full items-start gap-gutter max-md:gap-10\" data-v-425e4d9f><div class=\"industry-challenge__media w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl\" data-v-425e4d9f><div class=\"content-image block w-full\" data-v-425e4d9f><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRtYAAABXRUJQVlA4WAoAAAAQAAAAHwAAHAAAQUxQSDsAAAABL6AgbQPGv+l2x0REpAeKIkmNdh0ADi4lORzEvxz45hnR/wkoRdtfsidLMXAOIPjOnIixJ16Tda3nDwBWUDggdAAAAFAFAJ0BKiAAHQA/KYK3U64pJaKwDAHAJQljAL5pXIK4/rNNR30coqH+gyVLAXbeTPgYgAD+0LgyenvVIHX5DRpZxDDXUwGE/UhQACvVBHF/g7JH/ucDI+G/zmCXuMGWHgA6vzXOKn2s0OBdKQiRI7p5KAAA);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen.avif 1608w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 34rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen.webp 1608w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 34rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-challenge-home-reach.gen.webp\" alt=\"The Home Reach shared-ownership site we designed and built\" class=\"block w-full h-auto content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div><div class=\"industry-challenge__copy flex flex-col gap-10\" data-v-425e4d9f><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-425e4d9f><span class=\"size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-425e4d9f></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-425e4d9f>Challenge</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-challenge__headline text-4xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9\" data-v-425e4d9f>Property businesses don't need more AI tools, they need AI that works across the systems, data and workflows that already run the business.</h2><p class=\"text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-425e4d9f><span>Businesses are starting to use the power of AI. But fragmented tools, disconnected data and manual processes can leave teams with more tools, and no meaningful results. For property management, see </span><a href=\"/feed/ai-property-management-owned-agents-vs-tool-licence\" class=\"text-slatecolor underline underline-offset-4 decoration-slatecolor/60 transition-colors duration-300 ease-in-out hover:text-spark hover:decoration-spark/60\">when owned agents beat another tool licence</a><span>.</span></p><ul class=\"industry-challenge__points grid gap-8\" data-v-425e4d9f><li class=\"industry-challenge__point flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-425e4d9f><span class=\"text-2xl font-medium leading-none text-spark\" data-v-425e4d9f>01</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-425e4d9f>Fragmented tools</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-425e4d9f>More licences and logins, no joined-up capability.</p></li><li class=\"industry-challenge__point flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-425e4d9f><span class=\"text-2xl font-medium leading-none text-spark\" data-v-425e4d9f>02</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-425e4d9f>Disconnected data</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-425e4d9f>The information that matters sits in separate systems.</p></li><li class=\"industry-challenge__point flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-425e4d9f><span class=\"text-2xl font-medium leading-none text-spark\" data-v-425e4d9f>03</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-medium text-slatecolor\" data-v-425e4d9f>Manual processes</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-425e4d9f>Work that cannot scale without adding headcount.</p></li></ul></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
