      "html": "<div class=\"bg-chalk w-full\" data-v-7c7ec91f><section id=\"section-property-solution\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-grid__row--media industry-grid__row grid w-full gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>Solution</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>Build an AI engine your business owns.</h2><p class=\"max-w-prose text-lg leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-76bbf753>We connect AI to your key workflows, knowledge and systems. It becomes part of how your business operates, rather than another licence your teams have to manage.</p></div><ul class=\"industry-grid__items--two industry-grid__items grid w-full items-start gap-x-16 gap-y-14\" data-v-7c7ec91f><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Estate &amp; letting agents</p><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Win more instructions &amp; convert more leads.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Reply to portal leads in minutes, book viewings and valuations without the back and forth, and draft listings and offer letters in one click. Your negotiators spend the day with people, not paperwork.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Property management &amp; BTR</p><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Increase the number of homes you can manage.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Answer resident questions and log repairs the moment they come in. Chase arrears, renewals and compliance dates automatically. Give your team back the hours lost to admin and re-entering in systems.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Builders &amp; developers</p><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Take in leads &amp; quote faster, keep sites moving.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Respond to every enquiry faster and know which ones are worth chasing. Turn a spec into a quote in hours, not days. Keep materials ordered on time and spot the delays before they cost you a build week.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Proptech</p><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Build AI into your product to scale revenue.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Build AI with your own data, integrated with how users already work. Scale revenue without needing to increase headcount. We design and ship it with your team, and you own what gets built.</p></li></ul></div><div class=\"industry-grid__media relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"content-image absolute inset-0 h-full w-full content-image--fill\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"content-image__placeholder\" style=\"background-image:url(data:image/webp;base64,UklGRmgAAABXRUJQVlA4IFwAAAAwBACdASogADgAPzF+tVOzqCUis/zIAnAmCWMAAN6ChlBH2dbPuVpPUCAA/u/1Nc4X1DRSkVCOoHbBX0br/mWgMMXvzEs/6mB096r/lSyy6oyjHP9pYTvPDSgAAA==);\"></div><picture class=\"content-image__picture\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen-640w.avif 640w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen-1280w.avif 1280w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen.avif 1512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 32rem\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen-640w.webp 640w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen-1280w.webp 1280w, /content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen.webp 1512w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 32rem\"><img src=\"/content-media/pages/industries/property-solution-upstix.gen.webp\" alt=\"The Upstix valuation flow we designed and built\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover object-top content-image__main\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" draggable=\"false\"></source></source></picture></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
