      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-light-page\" data-v-44658b7a><section id=\"section-property-capabilities\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-24 py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-44658b7a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-44658b7a data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>How we help</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>AI built for your property business.</h2></div><div class=\"industry-capabilities__groups grid w-full items-start gap-x-gutter gap-y-16\" data-v-44658b7a><section class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-44658b7a><h3 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-spark\" data-v-44658b7a>Increase efficiency with AI automation</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Identify high-value workflows and redesign how parts of your business run with AI. From design, to rapid build sprints and roll-out with your team.</p><ul class=\"industry-capabilities__items grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 pt-8\" data-v-44658b7a><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-44658b7a><h4 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-44658b7a>Property operations</h4><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Automate repetitive workflows across lettings, property management, maintenance, compliance and customer service.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-44658b7a><h4 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-44658b7a>Sales &amp; marketing</h4><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Qualify demand, accelerate lead response, personalise customer responses and help teams convert more opportunities.</p></li></ul></section><section class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-44658b7a><h3 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-spark\" data-v-44658b7a>Grow revenue with AI product development</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Turn your expertise into a product you can scale and sell. We take you from proving value, through to design &amp; launch.</p><ul class=\"industry-capabilities__items grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 pt-8\" data-v-44658b7a><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-44658b7a><h4 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-44658b7a>Property intelligence</h4><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Build datasets from your portfolio that you can use to create insights, license data, and build intelligence that can be sold as a product.</p></li><li class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" data-v-44658b7a><h4 class=\"industry-capabilities__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-44658b7a>AI-native products</h4><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-44658b7a>Create new products and business propositions with AI - such as a value add to your services, or a completely new way to scale revenue streams.</p></li></ul></section></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
