      "html": "<div class=\"bg-chalk w-full\" data-v-7c7ec91f><section id=\"section-property-process\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-16 py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"industry-grid__row grid w-full gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-16\" data-v-7c7ec91f><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-6\" data-v-7c7ec91f data-v-76bbf753><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-v-76bbf753><span class=\"industry-section-header__dot shrink-0 rounded-full bg-spark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-76bbf753></span><p class=\"text-xs font-fono font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-haze-60 text-spark\" data-v-76bbf753>Process</p></div><h2 class=\"industry-section-header__headline text-5xl font-normal leading-tight text-slatecolor max-md:text-4xl max-md:leading-10\" data-v-76bbf753>How we work with property businesses.</h2></div><ul class=\"industry-grid__items--two industry-grid__items grid w-full items-start gap-x-16 gap-y-14\" data-v-7c7ec91f><li class=\"industry-grid__step flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><span class=\"font-fono text-sm font-medium tracking-wider text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>01</span><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Identify the value</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Map your systems &amp; workflows to identify where AI can create meaningful commercial impact.</p></li><li class=\"industry-grid__step flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><span class=\"font-fono text-sm font-medium tracking-wider text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>02</span><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Prioritise what matters</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Focus investment on the workflows or products with the clearest potential to improve revenue, margin, and customer experience.</p></li><li class=\"industry-grid__step flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><span class=\"font-fono text-sm font-medium tracking-wider text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>03</span><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Build and integrate</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Design the experience, build the AI capability and integrate it into the systems your teams already use.</p></li><li class=\"industry-grid__step flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-7c7ec91f><span class=\"font-fono text-sm font-medium tracking-wider text-spark\" data-v-7c7ec91f>04</span><h3 class=\"industry-grid__title text-2xl font-medium leading-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-7c7ec91f>Hand over ownership</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-normal text-haze-800\" data-v-7c7ec91f>You own what we build. Your team gets a capability that can evolve as your business and AI itself change.</p></li></ul></div></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"pointer-events-auto w-fit\" data-v-7c7ec91f><button type=\"button\" class=\"relative inline-flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full tracking-tight cursor-pointer transition-all duration-150 ease-out text-center outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-spark focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-charcoal border border-transparent text-chalk bg-spark shadow-button hover:bg-spark-100 hover:text-slatecolor font-medium text-sm leading-normal py-3.5 px-7\"><span class=\"relative z-10\">Talk to us</span></button></a></section></div>"
